  "date": "October 2026",
  "abstract": "Covers Open Responses, the open, vendor-neutral specification for multi-provider LLM APIs based on the OpenAI Responses API. Release 2026-04-24 is the current line and 2026-01-15 is supported: POST /v1/responses with items as the unit of context, item state machines, content, reasoning, the agentic tool loop with function calls, hosted tools, tool_choice and allowed_tools, previous_response_id, truncation, service_tier and errors; semantic streaming events over server-sent events; WebSocket mode with response.create, connection-local continuation, reconnects and error envelopes; POST /v1/responses/compact; assistant phase; slug-prefixed extension items, tools, events and fields; and the browser and CLI compliance tests. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out the version lines and upgrade, the request, item and tool model, streaming and WebSocket mode, and extensions and compliance.",
